  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_12
    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
    value: <style=title><size=42>MAIN WHEEL BONUS
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>BONUS WHEEL FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2
    value: "<size=23>- Receiving Mini, Minor, Major, or Mega Jackpot on the Main Wheel
      awards one\n   re-spin.\n- Wheel slice with \"+ Bonus Wheel\" tag awards a spin
      in the Bonus Wheel \n   before returning to Main Wheel.\n- Main Wheel bonus
      ends when user receives Free Games or the Grand Jackpot.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: '<size=24>- Bonus Wheel is triggered when user wins a slice with the "+Bonus
      Wheel" tag.

      - Bonus Wheel is composed of multipliers between x2 and x10.

      - The multiplier is applied to the just previous win amount from the Main Wheel.

      - Return to Main Wheel when Bonus Wheel ends.

'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4
    value: <style=title><size=42>MULTIPLIER WILD FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24>- Wild Symbol appears in reels 2, 3, and 4 only. \r\n- In Free
      Games, Wild symbols have either x2 or x3 multipliers.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5
    value: "<size=24>- Free Games is triggered by 3 or more Scatters.\n- A different
      Scatter appears in Free Games than in Base Game.\r\n- 2 or more Scatters awards
      additional Free Games.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>2000 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 100</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_12
    value: "<size=20>3 or more Scatters triggers the\n Wheel Bonus.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=20>Wild substitutes for all symbols\n except Scatter and appears
      \non reels 2, 3 and 4 only.\n"
